{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"fe734f1d69baabcb0c69d151a400c51841f909489675361a25a7b1b0728ab320"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:b6d8d2b6d62ffe5781cf2c61cda080a77dc212a05ea140365861c4a780eb6998","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Not really, he seemed content with his dogs and his hobbies kept him fulfilled before he started dating.","evidence":"[D9:16 | 7:01 pm on 4 May, 2022] James: My pets, computer games, travel and pizza are all that bring me happiness in life.","itemId":"urn:uuid:016ede3c-9ef7-54e4-adda-9a0e19a5a468","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e883c17853af077f41330cbc978961263f6bff8f6da3fd47c7b9c172c284c5e3","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Was James feeling lonely before meeting Samantha?","referenceAnswer":"Most likely yes, because he mentioned that the only creatures that gave him joy are dogs and he was actively trying to date.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e883c17853af077f41330cbc978961263f6bff8f6da3fd47c7b9c172c284c5e3"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}